1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/mysql/mysql-transaction","children":["MySQL 底层原理丨事务的实现（及三种日志）"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"article-hero article-cover","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"u-photo","src":"https://hedon.top/hedonspace/banner/mysql-transaction.jpg","alt":"MySQL 底层原理丨事务的实现（及三种日志） 的文章封面"}]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"数据库"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"MySQL 底层原理丨事务的实现（及三种日志）"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本文将从第一性原理出发，深入剖析 MySQL 的事务实现原理，并详细介绍三种日志（Redo Log、Undo Log、Binlog）的原理、应用场景及使用方法。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-12-18T23:37:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/12/18"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","7,900"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"mysql-的事务是如何实现的","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#mysql-的事务是如何实现的","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#mysql-的事务是如何实现的"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"MySQL 的事务是如何实现的？","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":4,"offset":3},"end":{"line":1,"column":20,"offset":19}}}]},"children":"MySQL 的事务是如何实现的？"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"MySQL 的事务是一个非常复杂的话题，在思考这个问题的时候，想要即触及重点又不显得啰嗦，就需要采用\"总-分-总\"的结构，并紧扣 ACID 这一核心模型来展开。"}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["$","span","span-0",{"className":"garden-callout-marker garden-callout-marker--success","aria-hidden":"true"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"一句话核心"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"MySQL（InnoDB 引擎）的事务实现，本质上就是为了保证 ACID 特性。它的底层主要依赖两类日志（redo log & undo log）和一套并发控制机制（锁 & MVCC）来共同完成。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"原子性（Atomicity）"}],"：靠 Undo Log。原子性保证事务要么全部成功，要么全部失败。这是通过 Undo Log（回滚日志）实现的。它记录了数据的逻辑反向操作（比如 Insert 对应 Delete）。如果事务失败或回滚，利用 Undo Log 就能把数据恢复到事务开始之前的状态。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"持久性（Durability）"}],"：靠 Redo Log（WAL）。持久性保证提交的数据不丢失。这是通过 Redo Log（重放日志）实现的。它遵循 WAL（Write-Ahead Logging）原则，事务提交时先写日志再刷盘。即使宕机，重启后也能通过 Redo Log 重放来恢复数据。另外，Bin Log 和 Redo Log 通过两阶段提交（2PC）来保证逻辑一致性。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"隔离性（Isolation）"}],"：靠锁和 MVCC 机制。隔离性是为了解决并发问题，InnoDB 提供了两种手段。\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"写操作（当前读）：依赖锁机制（如 Record Lock、Gap Lock、Next-Key Lock）来防止脏读和幻读。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"读操作（快照读）：依赖 MVCC（多版本并发控制），通过 ReadView + Undo Log 版本链实现不加锁的非阻塞读，极大提高了并发性能。"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"一致性（Consistency）"}],"：一致性是事务的最终目标。它是通过上述的原子性、持久性和隔离性共同保障的，同时还需与业务层面的逻辑约束（如外键）来配合。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["所以简单来说，",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Redo Log 保证了数据不丢，Undo Log 保证了可以后悔，MVCC 和锁保证了并发安全，最终实现了事务的一致性。"}]]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"id":"redo-log-是怎么实现持久性的","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#redo-log-是怎么实现持久性的","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#redo-log-是怎么实现持久性的"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"redo log 是怎么实现持久性的？","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":4,"offset":1037},"end":{"line":22,"column":23,"offset":1056}}}]},"children":"redo log 是怎么实现持久性的？"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"对 ACID 有了全局视野上的认知后，那么第一个问题就来了，redo log 是如何实现持久性的？"}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["$","span","span-0",{"className":"garden-callout-marker garden-callout-marker--success","aria-hidden":"true"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"一句话核心"}]}],"\n","$L8","\n"]}],"\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47","\n","$L48","\n","$L49","\n","$L4a","\n","$L4b","\n","$L4c","\n","$L4d","\n","$L4e","\n","$L4f","\n","$L50","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$L51","\n","$L52","\n","$L53","\n","$L54","\n","$L55","\n","$L56","\n","$L57","\n","$L58","\n","$L59","\n","$L5a","\n","$L5b","\n","$L5c","\n","$L5d","\n","$L5e","\n","$L5f","\n","$L60","\n","$L61","\n","$L62","\n","$L63","\n","$L64","\n","$L65","\n","$L66","\n","$L67","\n","$L68","\n","$L69","\n","$L6a","\n","$L6b","\n","$L6c","\n","$L6d","\n","$L6e","\n","$L6f","\n","$L70","\n","$L71","\n","$L72","\n","$L73","\n","$L74","\n","$L75","\n","$L76","\n","$L77","\n","$L78","\n","$L79","\n","$L7a","\n","$L7b","\n","$L7c","\n","$L7d","\n","$L7e","\n","$L7f","\n","$L80","\n","$L81","\n","$L82","\n","$L83","\n","$L84","\n","$L85","\n","$L86","\n","$L87","\n","$L88","\n","$L89","\n","$L8a","\n","$L8b","\n","$L8c","\n","$L8d","\n","$L8e","\n","$L8f","\n","$L90","\n","$L91","\n","$L92","\n","$L93","\n","$L94","\n","$L95","\n","$L96","\n","$L97","\n","$L98","\n","$L99","\n","$L9a","\n","$L9b","\n","$L9c","\n","$L9d","\n","$L9e","\n","$L9f","\n","$La0","\n","$La1","\n","$La2","\n","$La3","\n","$La4","\n","$La5","\n","$La6","\n","$La7","\n","$La8","\n","$La9","\n","$Laa","\n","$Lab","\n","$Lac","\n","$Lad","\n","$Lae"]}]}],"$Laf","$Lb0","$Lb1"]}],"$Lb2"]}]]}]}]
