8:["$","p","p-2",{"children":"Redo Log 实现持久性的核心思想是 WAL（Write-Ahead Logging，日志先行）技术，简单来说就是：先顺序写日志，后提交事务，再写磁盘数据。"}]
9:["$","p","p-3",{"children":"具体来说包含 3 个方面："}]
a:["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"利用顺序写替代随机写（性能基础）"}],"：当事务修改数据时，InnoDB 只是修改了内存（Buffer Pool）中的数据页，此时数据变成了",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"脏页"}],"。 如果每次修改都直接把数据页刷入磁盘，那是",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"随机 I/O"}],"，性能非常差。 所以，InnoDB 先把对数据页的",["$","strong","strong-3",{"children":"物理修改"}],"记录到 Redo Log 中。Redo Log 是追加写的，属于",["$","strong","strong-4",{"children":"顺序 I/O"}],"，速度非常快。只要日志落盘了，事务就算成功了。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"刷盘策略"}],"：为了保证日志真的落盘，InnoDB 提供了 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit"}]," 参数。 实现 ACID 中",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"严格持久性"}],"的关键在于将该参数设置为",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"1"}],"。 这意味着：每次事务提交时，都会强制调用 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"fsync"}]," 将 Redo Log Buffer 中的日志刷入磁盘。只有刷盘成功，事务才算 Commit 成功。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"崩溃恢复"}],"：如果 MySQL 宕机，内存里的",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"脏页"}],"还没来得及刷入磁盘（丢失了）。 但在重启时，InnoDB 会读取磁盘上的 Redo Log，根据日志里的物理修改记录（比如把第 10 页偏移量 50 的值改为 A），重新把这些操作在内存里执行一遍。 这个过程叫",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"Crash Recovery"}],"，它保证了即使宕机，提交过的数据也绝对不会丢失。"]}],"\n"]}]
b:["$","p","p-4",{"children":["另外，Redo Log 是循环写入的（Circular Buffer），配合 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Checkpoint"}]," 机制。当脏页真正刷入磁盘后，对应的 Redo Log 空间就可以被覆盖重用了。"]}]
c:["$","h2","h2-2",{"id":"redo-log-是如何进行崩溃恢复的持久性原子性","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#redo-log-是如何进行崩溃恢复的持久性原子性","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#redo-log-是如何进行崩溃恢复的持久性原子性"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"redo log 是如何进行崩溃恢复的？(持久性+原子性)","position":{"start":{"line":40,"column":4,"offset":1994},"end":{"line":40,"column":33,"offset":2023}}}]},"children":"redo log 是如何进行崩溃恢复的？(持久性+原子性)"}]}]
d:["$","p","p-5",{"children":"接下来最复杂的地方就是 redo log 它凭什么能支持崩溃恢复？"}]
e:["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"redo-log-的存储结构是怎样的","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#redo-log-的存储结构是怎样的","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#redo-log-的存储结构是怎样的"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"redo log 的存储结构是怎样的？","position":{"start":{"line":44,"column":5,"offset":2064},"end":{"line":44,"column":24,"offset":2083}}}]},"children":"redo log 的存储结构是怎样的？"}]}]
f:["$","p","p-6",{"children":"首先我们要看一下 redo log 的底层结构是怎样的："}]
10:["$","ul","ul-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"redo log 是循环写入的，底层会将 redo log 分成一个个的 redo log block，每个 block 大小为 512MB。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"事务中执行修改类 SQL 的时候，在修改完内存数据（buffer pool）每条会生成 LSN（Log Sequence Number），然后 WAL 写到 redo log block 中。注意，这里一个事务会生成多个 LSN，多个事务是并发执行的，所以多个事务之间的 LSN 是可能存在交替的。也就是说，为提交事务的 LSN 也可能会被刷盘哦！（后面会详细展开为什么可以这样）"}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":"LSN 是逻辑上日志按照时间顺序从小到大的编码，在 innodb 上，LSN 是一个 64 位的整数，取的是从数据库安装启动开始，到当前所写入的总的日志字节数。"}],"\n"]}]
11:["$","p","p-7",{"children":["$","$Lb3","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/0*xmXBaxykPRbdEMwV.png","alt":"","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/0*xmXBaxykPRbdEMwV.png","alt":""},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":1,"offset":2466},"end":{"line":52,"column":79,"offset":2544}}}}]}]
12:["$","p","p-8",{"children":"需要注意的是，redo log 也不是直接写磁盘的，也是先写 redo log buffer，然后再刷盘的。"}]
13:["$","p","p-9",{"children":["$","$Lb3","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20251218142704578.png","alt":"","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20251218142704578.png","alt":""},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":58,"column":1,"offset":2604},"end":{"line":58,"column":84,"offset":2687}}}}]}]
14:["$","p","p-10",{"children":["所以要保证真正的持久性，还需要结合 redo log 的刷盘策略配置：",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/innodb-parameters.html#sysvar_innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/innodb-parameters.html#sysvar_innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit","position":{"start":{"line":60,"column":37,"offset":2725},"end":{"line":60,"column":67,"offset":2755}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":60,"column":36,"offset":2724},"end":{"line":60,"column":170,"offset":2858}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit"}]," ，InnoDB 提供了 3 种策略："]}]
15:["$","ul","ul-2",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"0"}],"：每秒刷一次磁盘"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"1"}],"：每提交一个事务，就刷一次磁盘。最安全！这是保证持久性的必要条件！也是 InnoDB 的默认值！"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"2"}],"：每次事务提交时，写到 OS Cache，但不立即 Flush。Flush 由后台线程每秒做一次。"]}],"\n"]}]
