34:["$","blockquote","blockquote-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"为什么先执行 redo 再执行 undo？"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"因为 undo log 也是\"数据\"，它也要\"写 redo log\"！所以 redo 后，undo log 就恢复如初了！这个时候才可以 undo。"}],"\n"]}]
