9a:["$","blockquote","blockquote-9",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["$","span","span-0",{"className":"garden-callout-marker garden-callout-marker--danger","aria-hidden":"true"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"核心思想"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"当有多个事务并发提交时，MySQL 维护了一个队列，第一个抢到锁的事务（第一个进入空队列）成为队长 (Leader)，后面排队的事务成为队员 (Follower)。队长会代表所有队员，一次性完成 IO 操作。"}]}],"\n"]}]
9b:["$","p","p-86",{"children":"这个过程分为三个阶段的队列："}]
9c:["$","ol","ol-10",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Flush 阶段（写 OS Cache）"}],"：队长带着一群队员，把他们各自的 Binlog 数据写入操作系统的",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"文件缓存 (OS Cache)"}],"。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Sync 阶段（刷磁盘 fsync）"}],"：队长调用一次 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"fsync()"}],"。因为大家的数据都在 OS Cache 里了，这一次 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"fsync"}],"就把",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"这一整车人"}],"的 Binlog 全都持久化到磁盘了。原本 10 个事务需要 10 次 fsync，现在 1 次搞定。吞吐量直接翻倍。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Commit 阶段（引擎层提交）"}],"：队长通知 InnoDB 引擎，把这批事务在 Redo Log 里的状态由 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Prepare"}]," 改为 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Commit"}],"。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
