a0:["$","ol","ol-11",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Flush 阶段"}],"：队长把 Binlog 写进 OS Cache。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Redo Log 刷盘"}],"：在队长执行 Binlog 的 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"fsync"}],["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"之前"}],"，InnoDB 发现：\"哎？既然你们这一车人都要提交了，那你们对应的 Redo Log (Prepare 状态) 肯定也要落盘啊\"。于是，InnoDB 会把这一组事务的 Redo Log",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"一次性"}]," 刷入磁盘。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Sync 阶段"}],"：队长执行 Binlog 的 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"fsync"}],"。"]}],"\n"]}]
